<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Kris shares debut at 5.40 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Kris shares debut at 5.40 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kris Components Bhd made their market debut on Wednesday at 5.40 ringgit against an offer price of 2.60.</p>
<p>The precision metal parts manufacturing and stamping firm offered 8.442 million vendor and 6.249 million new shares in its initial public offering.  </p>
<p>About five minutes into the opening, the stock was at 6.10 ringgit with 705,000 shares traded. It had traded between 5.40 and 6.10 ringgit.</p>
<p>Kris forecast pretax profit of 14.54 million ringgit for the year to June 30, 1997 or net earnings per share of 20.6 cents.</p>
</text>
